398
00:15:07,457 --> 00:15:10,754
Wikipedia names it the Carroll Shelby Children's

399
00:15:10,754 --> 00:15:11,509
Foundation.

400
00:15:11,860 --> 00:15:15,138
In nineteen ninety-six he received a kidney,

401
