467
00:17:55,304 --> 00:17:56,321
A few numbers,

468
00:17:56,321 --> 00:17:57,556
from the sources.

469
00:17:57,736 --> 00:17:59,991
Born in nineteen twenty-three,

470
00:17:59,991 --> 00:18:01,645
died in twenty twelve,

471
00:18:01,645 --> 00:18:05,027
which by our arithmetic is eighty-nine years.

472
00:18:05,207 --> 00:18:06,821
Married seven times.

473
00:18:07,001 --> 00:18:08,510
Two transplants.

474
00:18:08,690 --> 00:18:11,291
Thirty race wins in a Ferrari in

475
00:18:11,291 --> 00:18:12,591
