480
00:18:25,062 --> 00:18:26,850
And the numbers that came later.

481
00:18:27,030 --> 00:18:29,760
The first Cobra sold for thirteen point

482
00:18:29,760 --> 00:18:31,650
seven five million dollars.

483
00:18:31,830 --> 00:18:34,036
The Super Snake for five million.

484
00:18:34,216 --> 00:18:37,720
A good condition four hundred twenty-seven S

485
00:18:37,720 --> 00:18:40,108
slash C is valued at two point

486
00:18:40,108 --> 00:18:43,453
two five million by Hagerty's April twenty

487
00:18:43,453 --> 00:18:44,886
twenty-five guide.

