504
00:19:15,778 --> 00:19:18,243
There is one more kind of number:

505
00:19:18,243 --> 00:19:18,692
years.

506
00:19:18,872 --> 00:19:22,765
From the prototype's arrival in February nineteen

507
00:19:22,765 --> 00:19:25,387
