508
00:19:25,387 --> 00:19:28,247
Le Mans win in nineteen sixty-six is

509
00:19:28,247 --> 00:19:29,597
about four years,

510
00:19:29,597 --> 00:19:31,027
by our arithmetic.

511
00:19:31,207 --> 00:19:34,127
In that time Shelby went from installing

512
00:19:34,127 --> 00:19:36,391
