541
00:20:33,158 --> 00:20:35,203
so we do not claim anything about

542
00:20:35,203 --> 00:20:35,513
that.

543
00:20:35,863 --> 00:20:37,221
What is his legacy?

544
00:20:37,401 --> 00:20:39,521
A car that looks as good as

545
00:20:39,521 --> 00:20:41,799
it did in nineteen sixty-two,

546
00:20:41,799 --> 00:20:44,940
a prototype that sold for thirteen point

547
00:20:44,940 --> 00:20:48,238
seven five million dollars in two thousand

548
00:20:48,238 --> 00:20:51,300
sixteen, and a reputation for turning a

549
00:20:51,300 --> 00:20:53,028
bad hand into a story.

550
00:20:53,208 --> 00:20:56,406
The sources also record disputes and failures,

551
00:20:56,406 --> 00:20:58,700
and a fair account has to include

552
00:20:58,700 --> 00:20:59,048
them.

553
00:20:59,228 --> 00:21:00,493
Both parts are true.

554
00:21:00,844 --> 00:21:02,562
Look at the dates once more.

555
00:21:02,742 --> 00:21:05,052
Born in nineteen twenty-three.

556
00:21:05,232 --> 00:21:08,262
A bankrupt farm in nineteen fifty-two.

557
00:21:08,442 --> 00:21:10,869
Le Mans in nineteen fifty-nine.

558
00:21:11,049 --> 00:21:13,290
Retired in nineteen sixty.

559
00:21:13,470 --> 00:21:16,291
